# Multi-seed interpretability replication (seeds 124+): keep the curated
# summaries / patching summaries / reports / figures, but ignore the bulky
# regenerable artefacts (synthetic traces, activation dumps, per-row patching
# logs, held-out eval rows). Regenerate with:
#   mimirbench run-multiseed-interpretability configs/interp_bayes_medium_multiseed.yaml
reports/training/small_transformer_bayes_medium_seed_*/*_traces.jsonl
reports/interpretability/interp_bayes_all_medium_seed_*/activations/
reports/interpretability/interp_bayes_all_medium_seed_*/activation_patching/patching_results.jsonl
reports/interpretability/interp_bayes_all_medium_seed_*/attention/attention_examples.jsonl
reports/interpretability/interp_bayes_medium_extended_seed_*/*.jsonl
reports/interpretability/interp_bayes_multiseed/heldout_eval_seed_*/results.jsonl

